Third-party material in this repository
---------------------------------------

tests/fixtures/bam-s355/*.csv
    From: Schilling, M., Glaubitz, S., Matzak, K., Rehmer, B., Skrotzki, B.
    (2022). Full dataset of several mechanical tests on an S355 steel sheet
    as reference data for digital representations (1.0.0). Zenodo.
    https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6778336
    Licence: CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
    Unchanged. Used as validation data for the test suite.

tests/fixtures/braunschweig-14125/*.CSV
    From: Osten, A., Steinmetz, J., Charif, S., Voelkerink, O. (2025).
    Moisture uptake, flexural properties, and mode I fracture toughness of
    hemp fiber reinforced polymer laminates with embedded capacitive
    sensor. Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17611621
    Licence: CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
    One export, unchanged. Used as test data for the importer and the
    window. The test suite fetches the rest of the same archive at test
    time; testXpert's results transcribed from its protocols are in
    tests/validation/braunschweig-14125-agreed.json.

tests/fixtures/puf-d1621/*
    From: Pires da Silva, E. H. (2023). Aged PUF compression tests
    (version 3). Mendeley Data. https://doi.org/10.17632/2sp8fyvhfm.3
    Licence: CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
    Two files (one test and its batch's dimensions), unchanged. Used as
    test data for the importer and the ISO 844 profile.

Data used by the test suite but not included
--------------------------------------------

NPL TENSTAND Premium Quality ASCII datafiles (National Physical
Laboratory, TENSTAND project, EU G6RD-CT-2000-00412). Fetched at test time
from npl.co.uk; no licence is stated for them, so they are not included.
The agreed values in tests/validation/tenstand-agreed.json are transcribed
from NPL Report DEPC MPE 015 (2005), Table 9.
